# Review ownership for the paths that a build-time compromise would need.
#
# Context: in October 2026 this repository was hit by the PolinRider campaign,
# which merged an obfuscated loader into `apps/web/postcss.config.cjs` and
# added Windows push-automation files to `.gitignore`. Both are now removed
# from every branch and from history. These rules make the same change
# require a second pair of eyes next time.
#
# Enforcing this needs "Require review from Code Owners" enabled on `main` in
# branch protection; the file alone is advisory.

# --- build and tooling config: the loader's favourite hiding place ---------
*postcss.config.*   @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*tailwind.config.*  @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*eslint.config.*    @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*next.config.*      @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*vite.config.*      @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*webpack.config.*   @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*babel.config.*     @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
*tsconfig*.json     @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
.gitignore          @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293
.npmrc              @BIGSMKE12 @davy-patty @Obaara293

# --- dependency graph ------------------------------------------------------
